[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[3GThe test's subject[22Gwas the [3mfirst[23m one.[41GIts[45Gname[50Gsays[55Gso[58G—[60G[38;2;177;185;249mtest_a_defect_is_loud_and_does_not_claim_unavailability[116G[39m—[118Gand[122Gits[126Gassertions[137Gare[141Gall[145Gabout[151Gthe[155Glogger:[163G[38;2;177;185;249mlog.error.assert_called_once()[39m,[195G[38;2;177;185;249mexc_info[204G[39mpresent,[213Gthe[217Greason[224Gstring[231Gnot[235Gsaying[2C[1B"unavailable".[18GSo[21G[38;2;177;185;249mdegrade.logger[36G[39mgot[40Gpatched,[49Gbecause[57Gyou[61Gcan't[67Gassert[74Gon[77Gwhat[82Gyou[86Gdon't[92Gmock.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mrunlog.log_event[20G[39mwasn't[27Gpart[32Gof[35Gany[39Gassertion,[50Gso[53Gnothing[61Gdrew[66Gattention[76Gto[79Git.[83GUnpatched[93Gcode[98Gdoesn't[106Gannounce[115Gitself[122G—[124Git[127Gjust[132Gruns.[138GThe[142Gtest[147Gcalled[154Ga[156Gfunction[165Gwhose[171Gwhole[177Gpurpose[185Gis[188Gemitting[197Gtwo[201Gsignals,[210Gstubbed[218Gthe[222Gone[226Git[229Gcared[235Gabout,[242Gand[246Glet[250Gthe[2C[1Both[7Gr[9Gone fire for real,[28G30 times.[K[2C[2B[1mW[5Gy[7Git stayed hidd[22Gn[24Gfor two days[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThree[9Gthings[16Ghad[20Gto[23Gline[28Gup,[32Gand[36Geach[41Gis[44Gindividually[57Greasonable:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe write is wrapped in [38;2;177;185;249mexcept Exception: pass[39m.[51G[22mThat's[58Gdeliberate[69G—[71G"reporting[82Ga[84Gbug[88Gmust[93Gnot[97Graise"[104Gis[107Gthe[111Gcorrect[119Gproperty.[129GBut[133Git[136Gmeans[142Gthe[146Greporting[156Gpath[161Gcannot[168Gcomplain[177Gabout[183Ganything,[193Gincluding[203Gbeing[209Gcalled[216Gfrom[221Ga[223Gtest.[229GAnd[233Git[236G[3msucceeded[23m,[247Gwhich[253Gis[2C[1Bquieter than failing.[25G[K[5C[2B[1mre's no test database.[22m The suite[39Gruns[44Gagainst[52Gthe[56Glive[61Gone.[66G[38;2;177;185;249mtests/conftest.py[84G[39malready[92Ghas[96Gan[99Gautouse[107Gfixture[115Gisolating[125G[38;2;177;185;249mARTERIES_*[136G[39menv[140Gbetween[148Gtests,[155Gso[158Gthe[162Gidea[167Gof[170Gtest[175Gisolation[185Gwas[189Gpresent[197G—[199Git[202Gjust[207Gcovered[215Genvironment[227Gvariables,[238Gnot[242Gwrites.[2C[2B[1mThe test isn't gated.[22m No [38;2;177;185;249mARTERIES_LIVE_TESTS[39m guard, so[58Ga p[62Gain [38;2;177;185;249mpytest tests/[39m wrote to production too, not only the[118Glive[123Gruns.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe part that actually cost time[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BThe rows looked completely authentic. Real event type, real project id, pla[79Gsible error, real run ids. Every fi[115Gld said "production". The only tell was in[158Gthe[162Gspool,[169Gnot[173Gthe[177Gdatabase[186G—[188G[38;2;177;185;249m"repo": "/tmp/dev-sync"[39m,[213Ga[215Gthrowaway[225Gworktree[234Gno[237Gcommand[245Gever[250Gruns[2C[1Bfrom.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BAnd[7Gthere's[15Ga[17Ggenuine[25Girony[31Ghere[36Gworth[42Gnaming[49Grather[56Gthan[61Gglossing:[71Gthe[75Gmodule[82Gbuilt[88Gto[91Gstop[96Gsilent[103Gfailures[112Gfrom[117Ghiding[124Gproduced[133Ga[135Gsilent[142Gfailure[150Gthat[155Ghid[159Ginside[166Gits[170Gown[174Gsignal.[182G[38;2;177;185;249minternal.bug_swallowed[205G[39mis[208Gthe[212Gone[216Gchannel[224Gwhere[230Gnoise[236Gis[239Gmost[244Gexpensive,[2C[1Bbecause a real swallowed def[32Gct [36Grrives looking exactly like the fixtures[77Gsurrounding i[91G.[93GIf a live one had fired in those two day[134G, I'd have skipped past it.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe systemic fix[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BThe[7Gper-test fix is d[26Ge. The class[39Gisn't:[46Gnothing[54Gprevents[63Gthe[67Gnext[72Gtest[77Gfrom[82Gwriting[90Gto[93Gthe[97Glive[102Gstore.[109GThe[113Gnatural[121Gguard[127Gextends[135Gthe[139Gfixture[147G