3 GB[39m has the same blind spot.[49GIt's[54Gsized[60Gfor[64Gweights,[73Gso[76Git[79Ggreen-lights[92Ga[94Gcard[99Gthat[104Gcan[108Ghold[113Gthe[117Gmodel[123Gbut[127Gnot[131Grun[135Git.[2C[2B[1mAnd arteries is switching the safeguard off[22m[K[2C[2BNine hook scripts do this, generated from [38;2;177;185;249msetup_cli.py:243[39m:[2C[2B[36mexport[39m RERANKER_DEVICE=[31m"[39m${RERANKER_DEVICE:-cuda}"[K[2C[2BLiteral [38;2;177;185;249m"cuda"[39m means device 0 — the fullest card — and it bypasses [38;2;177;185;249m_autodetect_device()[39m entirely. That function's own docstring describes this machine:[K[2C[2B[2m▎[22m [38;2;177;185;249m[3mtorch.cuda.is_available()[39m alone is the wrong question on a shared box: this machine also hosts an LLM server and the embedding server, and asking for the default device OOMs.[2C[2B[23mCapillaries wrote the[25Gright[31Gsafeguard.[42GArteries[51Goverrides[61Git[64Gwith[69Gthe[73Gwrong[79Ganswer,[87Geverywhere.[2C[2B[1mWhat I'd do, in order[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B1[6G[1mDrop the [38;2;177;185;249mRE[18GANKE[23G_DEVICE[39m line from the hooks.[22m Free, and it restores[74Gthe behaviour capillarie[100Gintended — pick the [121Gmptiest[129Gcard,[135Gfall[140Gback[145Gto[148GCPU[152Grather[159Gthan[164Gcrash.[2C[1B2[6G[1mLoad[11Gin bfloat16.[22m 2.4 GB → 1.2[37GGB, no quality cost.[K[2C[1B3.[6G[1mRaise [38;2;177;185;249mMIN_FREE_VRAM[39m to ~6 GB and drop [38;2;177;185;249mbatch_size[39m to 8.[22m Honest about[74Gactivations; th[91Gbatch is the bigg[109Gst sing[117Ge lever.[K[2C[1B4.[6G[1mThen consider a smaller model.[37G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mcross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2[74G[39mis[77G22M[81Gparams,[89G~90[93GMB[96G—[98G25×[102Gsmaller,[111Gand[115G[38;2;177;185;249mRERANKER_MODEL[130G[39malready[138Gexists[145Gas[148Gan[151Genv[155Gvar[159Gso[162Git's[167Ga[169Gone-line[178Gtrial.[1