[219Gyour[224Ggraph.[2C[2BIt's[8Gdirectly measurable, though: run the same real batch[61Gthrough bot[73G and compare the facts, the d[103Gdupe[108Gdecisio[116Gs, and th[127Grelations. Worth rem[148Gmbering the bar[164Gisn'[169G sky-high[179G—[181Gthe[185Gfalse[191Gcontradiction[205Gwe[208Gfixed[214Gan[217Ghour[222Gago,[227Gwhere[233Ga[235Gplan[240Gwas[244Gruled[250Gto[2C[1Bsupersede[13Gits[17Gown[21Gcompleted[31Goutcome,[40Gcame[45Gfrom[50Gthe[54G27B.[1B[K[2C[1BWant[8Gme[11Gto[14Gset[18Gboth[23Gservers[31Gup[34Gand[38Grun[42Gthat[47Gcomparison[58Gon[61Ga[63Glive[68Gbatch?[75GIt's[80Gconfig-only[92Gon[95Gthe[99Garteries[108Gside,[114Gand[118GI'd[122Ggive[127Gyou[131Ga[133Gside-by-side[146Gbefore[153Gyou[157Gcommit[164Gto[167Git.[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[39m [38;2;153;153;153mSautéed for 2m 22s[39m[K[1B[K[1B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mDo these first: 1. Drop the RERANKER_DEVICE line from the hooks. Free, and it restores the behaviour capillaries intended — pick the emptiest card, don't fall back to CPU [39m                                                                                 [1B  [38;2;255;255;255m2. Load in bfloat16. 2.4 GB → 1.2 GB, no quality cost.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [1B  [38;2;255;255;255m3. Raise MIN_FREE_VRAM to ~6 GB and drop batch_size to 8. Honest about activations; the batch is the biggest single lever.[39m                                                                                                                                  [1B[49m[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[39m Starting with the hooks — including the generator, or [38;2;177;185;249mart setup --sync[74G[39mwould[80Gput[84Gthe[88Gline[93Gback.[5C[1B[K[2C[1B[38;2;15