[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GSautéed for 2m 22s · 1 shell still running[2C[1B[39m[K[1B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mDo these first: 1. Drop the RERANKER_DEVICE line from the hooks. Free, and it restores the behaviour capillaries intended — pick the emptiest card, don't fall back to CPU [39m                                                                                 [1B  [38;2;255;255;255m2. Load in bfloat16. 2.4 GB → 1.2 GB, no quality cost.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [1B  [38;2;255;255;255m3. Raise MIN_FREE_VRAM to ~6 GB and drop batch_size to 8. Honest about activations; the batch is the biggest single lever.[39m                                                                                                                                  [2B[49m[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mStarting with the hooks — including the generator,[54Gor[57G[38;2;177;185;249mart setup --sync[74G[39mwould[80Gput[84Gthe[88Gline[93Gback.[2B  [38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m2[22m shell commands [39m[K[1B[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[39m Now the capillaries side — bfloat16, the VRAM threshold, and the batch.[K[2B [3G[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m2[22m shell commands [39m[K[2B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mNow testing it actually[27Gloads[33Gand[37Gscores[44Gin[47Gbf16.[2B [3G[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m1[22m shell command [39m[K[2B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39mThe dtype came back bf16[28Gon[31GCPU[35Geven[40Gwhere[46Gmy[49Gcode[54Gpasses[61Gno[64Gdtype[70G—[72Gso[75Gsentence-transformers[97Galready[105Ghonors[112Gthe[116Gcheckpoint[127Gdtype.[134GLet[138Gme[141Gverify[148Gthat[153Gproperly,[163Gbecause[171Git[174Gmeans[180Gmy[183Gbf16[188Gclaim[194Gwas[198Gwrong.[2B [3G[38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m1[22m shell command